# Changes made by another session (EXPUNGE, new message, flag change, new keyword) are all
# reported in the next response of a session, are reported only once, and the message
# sequence numbers it uses afterwards match the view the client built from these responses.
SESSION: 1
C: 1a CREATE mixedchanges
S: 1a OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed.

C: 1b APPEND mixedchanges {254+}
C: Date: Mon, 7 Feb 1994 21:52:25 -0800 (PST)
C: From: Fred Foobar <foobar@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: Subject: Test 01
C: To: mooch@owatagu.siam.edu
C: Message-Id: <B27397-0100000@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: MIME-Version: 1.0
C: Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; CHARSET=US-ASCII
C:
C: Test 01
C:
S: 1b OK (\[.+\] )?APPEND completed.

C: 1c APPEND mixedchanges {254+}
C: Date: Mon, 7 Feb 1994 21:52:25 -0800 (PST)
C: From: Fred Foobar <foobar@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: Subject: Test 02
C: To: mooch@owatagu.siam.edu
C: Message-Id: <B27397-0100000@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: MIME-Version: 1.0
C: Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; CHARSET=US-ASCII
C:
C: Test 02
C:
S: 1c OK (\[.+\] )?APPEND completed.

C: 1d APPEND mixedchanges {254+}
C: Date: Mon, 7 Feb 1994 21:52:25 -0800 (PST)
C: From: Fred Foobar <foobar@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: Subject: Test 03
C: To: mooch@owatagu.siam.edu
C: Message-Id: <B27397-0100000@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: MIME-Version: 1.0
C: Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; CHARSET=US-ASCII
C:
C: Test 03
C:
S: 1d OK (\[.+\] )?APPEND completed.

C: 1e APPEND mixedchanges {254+}
C: Date: Mon, 7 Feb 1994 21:52:25 -0800 (PST)
C: From: Fred Foobar <foobar@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: Subject: Test 04
C: To: mooch@owatagu.siam.edu
C: Message-Id: <B27397-0100000@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: MIME-Version: 1.0
C: Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; CHARSET=US-ASCII
C:
C: Test 04
C:
S: 1e OK (\[.+\] )?APPEND completed.

C: 1f SELECT mixedchanges
S: \* OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] Ok
S: \* FLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\Seen\)
S: \* 4 EXISTS
S: \* 4 RECENT
S: \* OK \[UIDVALIDITY \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[UNSEEN 1\].*
S: \* OK \[PERMANENTFLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\\Seen( \\\*)?\)\].*
S: \* OK \[HIGHESTMODSEQ \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[UIDNEXT 5\].*
S: 1f OK \[READ-WRITE\] SELECT completed.

SESSION: 2
C: 2a SELECT mixedchanges
S: \* OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] Ok
S: \* FLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\Seen\)
S: \* 4 EXISTS
S: \* 0 RECENT
S: \* OK \[UIDVALIDITY \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[UNSEEN 1\].*
S: \* OK \[PERMANENTFLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\\Seen( \\\*)?\)\].*
S: \* OK \[HIGHESTMODSEQ \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[UIDNEXT 5\].*
S: 2a OK \[READ-WRITE\] SELECT completed.

SESSION: 1
C: 1g STORE 2 +FLAGS.SILENT (\Deleted)
S: 1g OK STORE completed.

C: 1h EXPUNGE
S: \* 2 EXPUNGE
S: \* 3 RECENT
S: 1h OK EXPUNGE completed.

C: 1i APPEND mixedchanges {254+}
C: Date: Mon, 7 Feb 1994 21:52:25 -0800 (PST)
C: From: Fred Foobar <foobar@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: Subject: Test 05
C: To: mooch@owatagu.siam.edu
C: Message-Id: <B27397-0100000@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: MIME-Version: 1.0
C: Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; CHARSET=US-ASCII
C:
C: Test 05
C:
S: \* 4 EXISTS
S: \* 4 RECENT
S: 1i OK (\[.+\] )?APPEND completed.

C: 1j STORE 3 +FLAGS.SILENT ($Kw1)
S: \* FLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\Seen \$Kw1\)
S: \* OK \[PERMANENTFLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\Seen \$Kw1 \\\*\)\].*
S: 1j OK STORE completed.

SESSION: 2
C: 2b NOOP
S: \* 5 EXISTS
S: \* 2 EXPUNGE
S: \* 1 RECENT
S: \* FLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\Seen \$Kw1\)
S: \* OK \[PERMANENTFLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\Seen \$Kw1 \\\*\)\].*
S: \* 3 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\$Kw1\)\)
S: 2b OK NOOP completed.

C: 2c NOOP
S: 2c OK NOOP completed.

C: 2d FETCH 1:* (UID FLAGS BODY.PEEK[HEADER.FIELDS (SUBJECT)])
S: \* 1 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\) UID 1 BODY\[HEADER\.FIELDS \(SUBJECT\)\] \{20\}
S: Subject: Test 01
S:
S: \)
S: \* 2 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\) UID 3 BODY\[HEADER\.FIELDS \(SUBJECT\)\] \{20\}
S: Subject: Test 03
S:
S: \)
S: \* 3 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\$Kw1\) UID 4 BODY\[HEADER\.FIELDS \(SUBJECT\)\] \{20\}
S: Subject: Test 04
S:
S: \)
S: \* 4 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\\Recent\) UID 5 BODY\[HEADER\.FIELDS \(SUBJECT\)\] \{20\}
S: Subject: Test 05
S:
S: \)
S: 2d OK FETCH completed.

C: 2e STORE 2 +FLAGS (\Flagged)
S: \* 2 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\\Flagged\)\)
S: 2e OK STORE completed.

SESSION: 1
C: 1k NOOP
S: \* 2 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\\Flagged \\Recent\)\)
S: 1k OK NOOP completed.

C: 1l UID FETCH 3 (FLAGS)
S: \* 2 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\\Flagged \\Recent\) UID 3\)
S: 1l OK FETCH completed.

C: 1m STORE 1 +FLAGS.SILENT (\Deleted)
S: 1m OK STORE completed.

C: 1n EXPUNGE
S: \* 1 EXPUNGE
S: \* 3 RECENT
S: 1n OK EXPUNGE completed.

SESSION: 2
C: 2f NOOP
S: \* 1 EXPUNGE
S: 2f OK NOOP completed.

C: 2g FETCH 1:* (UID)
S: \* 1 FETCH \(UID 3\)
S: \* 2 FETCH \(UID 4\)
S: \* 3 FETCH \(UID 5\)
S: 2g OK FETCH completed.

SESSION: 1
C: 1o CLOSE
S: 1o OK CLOSE completed.

SESSION: 2
C: 2h CLOSE
S: 2h OK CLOSE completed.

SESSION: 1
C: 1p DELETE mixedchanges
S: 1p OK DELETE completed.
